I would not complain about finding artifacts on low levels (ie in shops or
bones levels).  It has been my experience that this happens very, very rarely.
In fact, the other day I say my first artifact besides Sting, Orcrist,
Excalibur (all of which can be obtained by various methods - see the spoilers)
and Mjollnir (which I usually get with the Wand of Wishing - Excalibur and
Mjollnir are a good combo).  In fact, I started the game out in the same room
as an axe named Cleaver - of course it was cursed, but it hacked orcs pretty
good just the same.  I found Excalibur in a shop once, he wanted a lot of gold
(over 6000, I am not sure how much - of course I did not pay for it).  Any way,
the point is, you don't have to worry too much about having a game _ruined_
by finding a powerful artifact too early in the game very often.  Besides, just
when you think that hack and slash is ALL you will have to do

you die...[more]

